    {
      "id": "note-overview",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": -720,
        "y": 300
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "ImageWriter saves a batch as one PNG per image, and ImageBatchReader reads the folder back. SyntheticSegmentation draws 8 images of 32 x 32 pixels with a circle or a rectangle on each; DatasetBatch stacks them into (8, 1, 32, 32), and ImageWriter writes shape_0.png to shape_7.png into output/image-batch-io under the data folder (assets/output in a project directory). The writer's directory output feeds the reader's directory input. That edge is what makes the read wait for the write; a trigger edge would not. ResizeTransform and ToTensorTransform are the reader's preprocessing chain, so the 8 images come back as (8, 1, 64, 64).\n\nImageWriter 把一個批次的每張影像各存成一個 PNG，ImageBatchReader 再把整個資料夾讀回來。SyntheticSegmentation 產生 8 張 32 x 32 像素的影像，每張上面有圓形或矩形；DatasetBatch 把它們堆成 (8, 1, 32, 32)，ImageWriter 把 shape_0.png 到 shape_7.png 寫進資料目錄下的 output/image-batch-io（專案目錄模式下是 assets/output）。寫入節點的 directory 輸出接到讀取節點的 directory 輸入，讀取會等寫入完成，靠的就是這條邊；觸發邊做不到這件事。ResizeTransform 與 ToTensorTransform 是讀取節點的前處理鏈，所以 8 張影像讀回來是 (8, 1, 64, 64)。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "start",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": -460,
          "y": 0
        },
        "noteWidth": 380
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-reader",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": 960,
        "y": 800
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "The reader reads every file that matches shape_*.png. Lower batch_size and run again, and the files left from the larger batch are read too; delete the folder to start clean.\n\n讀取節點會讀進所有符合 shape_*.png 的檔案。調小 batch_size 再執行一次時，先前較大批次留下的檔案也會被讀進來；要重新開始，請先刪除這個資料夾。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "reader",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 500
        },
        "noteWidth": 300
      }
    }
  ],
